cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Until final ACM publication metadata is available, please cite the associated
  arXiv preprint using the preferred citation below. No source release has been
  made yet.
type: software
title: MFEM Elasticity PA
abstract: >-
  The maintained open-source software companion to "Shifting the Sweet Spot:
  High-Performance Matrix-Free Method for High-Order Elasticity", accepted for
  publication in ACM Transactions on Architecture and Code Optimization. This
  repository is currently a documentation-only development preview.
